// D4: One Access Key Across Many Source IPs (Egress Pool)
// ATT&CK: T1090 (Proxy)
// Data Source: AWSCloudTrail
// Threshold: 3+ distinct source IPs for a single access key in 15 minutes
// FP Assessment: Legitimate multi-NAT or roaming egress; tune per
//   environment. Investigate any key that trips this.
// Hunt 24 — TideGlass | Jenna Frank

AWSCloudTrail
| summarize ips = dcount(SourceIpAddress), ipset = make_set(SourceIpAddress)
    by UserIdentityAccessKeyId, bin(TimeGenerated, 15m)
| where ips >= 3
